aditionally been authorized by the Legisla-\nture for individual municipalities. The oversight provisions included in\nthis bill will enable the City of Amsterdam to avoid future fiscal and\nbudgetary problems.\n\n \nLEGISLATIVE HISTORY:\n\nThis is a new bill.\n\n \nFISCAL IMPLICATIONS:\n\nNone to the State.\n\n \nEFFECTIVE DATE:\nThis act shall take effect immediately.\n",
